<title>USA: Tyco Toys Inc Q3 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Tyco Toys Inc Q3 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>MT. LAUREL, N.J. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyco Toys Inc</p>
<p>				 3 Mos ended 9/30    9 Mos ended 9/30</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		 $256,369 $226,285  $492,727   $494,037</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold     143,560  130,702   278,233    285,521</p>
<p> Gross profit	     112,809   95,583   214,494    208,516</p>
<p> Mktg, advtsg, promotions 52,919  44,423   110,315    109,530</p>
<p>Selling, distribution &amp;</p>
<p>  admin expenses	   32,441   31,666    84,389     87,494</p>
<p> Restructuring charge	  --	 --	  --	4,900</p>
<p>Amortization</p>
<p>  of goodwill		 1,576    1,634     4,799	4,825</p>
<p> Total oper expenses     86,936   77,723   199,503    206,749</p>
<p> Operating income	  25,873   17,860    14,991	1,767</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	 12,523    5,546   (1,443)    (9,958)</p>
<p> Net income after pfd divs 9,685   4,738   (5,997)  ( 12,340)</p>
<p>Net EPS (loss):</p>
<p>   Primary		     0.28     0.14    (0.17)     (0.35)</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted	     0.22     0.14    (0.17)     (0.35)</p>
<p>		   (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
</text>
